+/*
+ * Detach a swap-backed entry from its slot.  Caller holds the token lock
+ * and must memcomp_slot_put() the returned entry after unlocking.
+ */
+
+/* Release the slot of a dying swap-backed entry.  Atomic-context safe. */
+
